    "skills": {
      "skill1": "■ Activates at the start of battle. Affects self.\nInto the Fray: Serene Mind\nFunction: Normal attacks become wide-range piercing attacks and deal additional damage to the enemy.\nEffect 1: Affects self. Gains Pierce. This effect is continuous and cannot be removed.\nEffect 2: Affects self. Normal Attack Critical Rate ▲ 35%. This effect is continuous and cannot be removed.\nEffect 3: Activates when performing a normal attack. Affects the enemy unit nearest to the crosshair. Iai: Deals 109% of final ATK as additional damage.\n■ Activates when entering Full Burst. Affects self.\nCritical Damage ▲ 60% for 10 sec.",
      "skill2": "■ Activates after landing 2 critical hits with normal attacks while not in the Beyond the Fade: Full Bloom state. Affects self.\nReloads 1 round(s).\n■ Activates when using Burst Skill. Affects self.\nInto the Fray: At One With the Sword\nFunction: Enhances Iai damage and the offensive capabilities of normal attacks.\nEffect 1: Normal Attack Critical Rate ▲ 50% for 10 sec. This effect cannot be removed.\nEffect 2: Attack Damage ▲ 116% for 10 sec. This effect cannot be removed.\nEffect 3: Iai's additional damage is scaled by 100% for 10 sec. This effect cannot be removed.",
      "burst": "■ Affects self.\nBeyond the Fade: Full Bloom: Changes the weapon in use.\nFunction: Enhances Scarlet: Goddeath and increases the range of normal attacks.\nDamage: 115% of final ATK\nDuration: 10 sec\nAdditional Effects\nEffect 1: Normal Attack Range ▲ 100% for 10 sec. This effect cannot be removed.\nEffect 2: ATK ▲ 120% for 10 sec. This effect cannot be removed.\n■ Affects the 1 enemy unit(s) nearest to the crosshair.\nDeals 3000% of final ATK as additional damage."
